   "draft_text": "**edit \u2212 steering = \u22120.021 [\u22120.096, +0.050]; edit \u2212 SentenceDebias = \u22120.028 [\u22120.109, +0.043]; all three beat DPO (edit \u2212 DPO = +0.293 [+0.030, +0.540]).** The tie was pre-registered as a branch before any steering number existed, and it was **re-adjudicated after the v9 re-score under the same registered fork: no switch.**",
